      "body": "Bumps [astral-sh/setup-uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv) from 7.6.0 to 10.3.2.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/releases\">astral-sh/setup-uv's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v10.3.2 🌈 update known checksums for 0.13.5</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<h2>🧰 Maintenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.13.5 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1103\">#1103</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📚 Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>docs: update version references to v10.3.1 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1102\">#1102</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v10.3.1 🌈 preserve cache error class names in save-cache bundle</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>This release includes a fix so that multiple concurrent workflows trying to upload the same cache no longer warn</p>\n<p><code>##[warning]Failed to save: Unable to reserve cache with key ..., another job may be creating this cache.</code></p>\n<h2>🐛 Bug fixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>fix: preserve cache error class names in save-cache bundle <a href=\"https://github.com/dannyward630\"><code>@​dannyward630</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1093\">#1093</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🧰 Maintenance</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.13.4 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1099\">#1099</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.13.2/0.13.3 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1098\">#1098</a>)</li>\n<li>chore: update known checksums for 0.13.1 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1094\">#1094</a>)</li>\n<li>Verify npm dependency signatures before builds <a href=\"https://github.com/zaniebot\"><code>@​zaniebot</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1027\">#1027</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>📚 Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>docs: cache-dependency-glob matches relative to the working directory <a href=\"https://github.com/flange-ipb\"><code>@​flange-ipb</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1092\">#1092</a>)</li>\n<li>docs: update version references to v10.3.0 @<a href=\"https://github.com/apps/github-actions\">github-actions[bot]</a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1090\">#1090</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⬆️ Dependency updates</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>chore(deps): roll up Dependabot updates <a href=\"https://github.com/eifinger\"><code>@​eifinger</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1101\">#1101</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v10.3.0 🌈 Add Python architecture selection</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>This release adds the <code>python-arch</code> input to select a Python architecture independently of the Python version. With <code>uv</code> 0.13.0 or later, set <code>python-arch: x86_64</code> to use x64 Python on Windows ARM64 runners.</p>\n<p>It also includes embedded checksums for <code>uv</code> releases through 0.13.0.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use macOS 15 runners for tests <a href=\"https://github.com/charliermarsh\"><code>@​charliermarsh</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1081\">#1081</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🚀 Enhancements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add <code>python-arch</code> support <a href=\"https://github.com/zanieb\"><code>@​zanieb</code></a> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1079\">#1079</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/07a047e608db84b3d8c06cd9a7c7dcc9c355c18e\"><code>07a047e</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.13.5 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1103\">#1103</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/e1b85369e72750369c935b004eccf97311bdf5dc\"><code>e1b8536</code></a> docs: update version references to v10.3.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1102\">#1102</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/18d369b23da25a81e9458561248e1aafff6a70fa\"><code>18d369b</code></a> chore(deps): roll up Dependabot updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1101\">#1101</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/4ad2329c1e377d882fcae221cd1d17e7c0ad788e\"><code>4ad2329</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.13.4 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1099\">#1099</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/4bc6759c82322ff7efa28de54a45404ca6869912\"><code>4bc6759</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.13.2/0.13.3 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1098\">#1098</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/c97f06e356bcca1b426f396ef93ec35ce149ce7b\"><code>c97f06e</code></a> fix: preserve cache error class names in save-cache bundle (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1093\">#1093</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/8ca4be000bfa5f8e6aaa01d8470878c90aa728d3\"><code>8ca4be0</code></a> chore: update known checksums for 0.13.1 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1094\">#1094</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/b627d85691ead579b598a36169571b1c7123526f\"><code>b627d85</code></a> docs: cache-dependency-glob matches relative to the working directory (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1092\">#1092</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/f8c88970fcd8fff8e97bc62edc5f5c073a0527fe\"><code>f8c8897</code></a> Verify npm dependency signatures before builds (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1027\">#1027</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/commit/f64d32b1cd6cc11405a74665b3dfb7bb86fea9f0\"><code>f64d32b</code></a> docs: update version references to v10.3.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/issues/1090\">#1090</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/astral-sh/setup-uv/compare/37802adc94f370d6bfd71619e3f0bf239e1f3b78...07a047e608db84b3d8c06cd9a7c7dcc9c355c18e\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=astral-sh/setup-uv&package-manager=github_actions&previous-version=7.6.0&new-version=10.3.2)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
